<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 244 0 R
/E (The Secure QR Code Generator System is a centralized web-based platform that integrates QR generation, security enforcement, and monitoring into a single solution. Users can generate, manage, share, and analyze QR codes while the system transparently enforces security policies at every stage, from creation to scanning and content delivery.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
